flowchart LR
    subgraph Edge[Frontend and ingestion]
        FE[Web apps and SDKs<br/>pageview click session]
        API[Tracking API<br/>Node.js Express]
    end

    subgraph Operational[Operational storage]
        PG[(PostgreSQL<br/>source of truth<br/>writes only)]
    end

    subgraph Processing[Data movement]
        SW[Incremental sync worker<br/>high-water mark + retries]
        STG[DuckDB staging and transform step<br/>dedupe enrich compact]
    end

    subgraph Analytical[Storage and compute separation]
        D[(DuckDB hot tables<br/>7 to 30 day window)]
        P[(Parquet cold partitions<br/>data lake style storage)]
        C[(Cache<br/>memory now Redis later)]
        Q[Analytics API query layer<br/>reads DuckDB hot + Parquet cold]
        UI[Dashboard and exports<br/>charts reports CSV]
    end

    FE -->|sendBeacon or fetch| API
    API -->|validated inserts| PG

    PG -->|ordered batches by id or updated_at| SW
    SW -->|stage recent rows| STG
    STG -->|upsert recent data| D
    STG -->|write older partitions| P
    D --> Q
    P --> Q
    Q --> C
    C -->|cache hit| UI
    Q -->|cache miss populate cache| UI

    P -. open files for other engines .-> EXT[DuckDB Spark Trino Pandas]

    classDef storage fill:#e8f1ff,stroke:#1d4ed8,color:#111827;
    classDef process fill:#ecfdf5,stroke:#059669,color:#111827;
    classDef api fill:#fff7ed,stroke:#ea580c,color:#111827;

    class PG,D,P storage;
    class SW,STG process;
    class FE,API,Q,UI,C,EXT api;